<p>dashte ghurbat me watan se shahe dee'n jaate hain<br />
saath sab ghuncha dahan maah-e- jabee'n jaate hain<br />
ghul hai kounain-e- imaamat ke hasee'n jaate hain<br />
qaak hone ke liye arsh nashi'n jaate hain</p>

<p>gulshan-e baad-e- shah-e qilla shikan lut-ta hai<br />
jis me jannat ki fiza thi wo chaman lut-ta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haram-e- sheh me hai faryaad-o bukaa se kohraam<br />
bibiyan aayi hai ruqsat ko muhalle ki tamaam<br />
sab se milti hai gale ro ro ke hamsheer-e- imaam<br />
haath mal mal ke ye hamsaaiya'n karti hai kalaam</p>

<p>kya qayamat hai ke veeran ye ghar karte hain<br />
haaye is garmi me shabbir safar karte hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zikr ye tha ke shah-e yasrab-o bat'ha aaye<br />
ghar me maghmoom-o hazee'n syed-e wala aaye<br />
kaha madar se sakina ne ke baba aaye<br />
boli beemar ke haan mere masiha aaye</p>

<p>sheh ne zainab se kaha aur qalaq badhta hai<br />
aao sughra se bhi ruqsat ho ke din chadhta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>keh ke ye aaye qaree'n fatima sughra ke imaam<br />
kanpte haato'n se beti ne kiya uth ke salaam<br />
bole chaati se lagakar ye shah-e- arsh maqaam<br />
baitho baitho ke badan zof se larza'n hai tamaam</p>

<p>jo muqaddar me hai wo ranj nahi talta hai<br />
tap se tum jalti ho, gham se mera dil jalta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehke ye baith gaye paas imaam-e do sara<br />
baad alhamd padhi aap ne sehat ki dua<br />
aur beemar ko chaati se lagakar ye kaha<br />
beti tum ghar me raho, hai yahi marzi e quda</p>

<p>saath lete jo tawana tumhe paate bibi<br />
aise beemar safar me nahi jaate bibi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gir ke bistar pa ye chillayi basad aah o fugha'n<br />
are logo mujhe thamo ke chali jism se jaa'n<br />
ek ba ek phir gayi qismat ye huwa kya samaa'n<br />
haaye baba mujhe yaan chod ke jaaoge kahan</p>

<p>meri furqat huwi kis tarha gawara baba<br />
be ajal aap ne beemar ko maara baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>na jiyegi, na jiyegi ye mareez-e- ranjoor<br />
haaye mai ghar me rahu aur hu sab se door<br />
chodh de beti ko baba ye naya hai dastoor<br />
afu keeje koi sughra se huwa ho jo qusoor</p>

<p>aatish-e- ranj-o alam se na jaloongi baba<br />
kuch ho mai aap ke hamraah chalungi baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haath main jodti hoon ab mere achche baba<br />
paaun par girti hu mai, mujh ko na chodo tanha<br />
reham keeje meri minnat pa ye loundi ho fida<br />
meri bimari ka hazrat ko agar hai dhadka</p>

<p>acchi mai ho lu to ho yaa'n se rawana baba<br />
ya mai dunya se guzar jaaun to jaana baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baate'n sughra ki ye sunte the shah-e- kouno makaa'n<br />
aaye jo itne me hamshakle rasool-e- do jaha'n<br />
dekh kar bhai ko boli wo basad aah -o fugha'n<br />
aao bhayya ali akbar mai tumhare qurbaa'n</p>

<p>apna kuch bas nahi baba to hame chod chale<br />
tum bhi kya qaahar-e- nashad se mu mod chale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ham to mehmaan koi din ke hain jaao bhaai<br />
ab yaqeen hai ke hame aake na paao bhaai<br />
bu mujhe zulfe saman bu ki sunghao bhaai<br />
lu balaye'n mai zara paas to aao bhaai</p>

<p>aalame hijr me dunya se safar karte hain<br />
koi hasrat to na rahjaaye ke ham marte hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mere aashiq, mere shaida, mere pyare bhaiyya<br />
tum pa is qasta jigar ko koi waare bhaiyya<br />
mujh se ab chut'te ho sadqe mai tumhare bhaiyya<br />
tum chale aur hai bahan gor kinare bhaiyya</p>

<p>pahle turbat pa meri ashk bahate na gaye<br />
qabr beemar ki yasrab me banate na gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekhiye qair se is shehr me kab aaoge<br />
bhai phir chand si surat hame dikhlaoge<br />
apni shadi me bhi nashaad ko bulwaoge<br />
der se aaye to bahna ko na phir paaoge</p>

<p>ye wasiyat hai ke tum ghar me na jaana pahle<br />
sehra latkaaye meri qabr pa aana pahle<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>